3
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:25,000
The war will continue.

4
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:32,820
I wrote on my Telegram channel that, as I
have already explained, Medinsky is

5
00:00:32,820 --> 00:00:38,000
not a figure whose presence signals
serious intent.

6
00:00:39,000 --> 00:00:45,844
“Stall for time, Shura, stall for time.”
That's how I described what happened

7
00:00:45,844 --> 00:00:47,000
