10
00:00:59,000 --> 00:01:04,333
Forgive me, please, but I have to do this
for the sake of objectivity. We're

11
00:01:04,333 --> 00:01:07,000
now, I almost said for the first time—

12
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:13,228
No, not for the first time, of
course—going to behold the propagandist of
all

13
00:01:13,228 --> 00:01:18,000
Rus', Vladimir Rudolfovich Solovyov, also
known as Shapiro.

14
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:27,625
I'll explain later why I want to show you
this man, who also commented on the

15
00:01:27,625 --> 00:01:32,000
presence of Europeans at the talks.

16
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:35,878
They wanted to attend. Some even flew to
Abu Dhabi, but they weren't allowed

17
00:01:35,878 --> 00:01:37,000
into the negotiations.

18
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:45,861
And Solovyov is also trying to comment on
what happened with his usual

19
00:01:45,861 --> 00:01:47,000
rudeness.

20
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:53,382
I almost said a swear word. Let's listen
to Solovyov. Let us summon our

21
00:01:53,382 --> 00:01:55,000
