32
00:02:36,000 --> 00:02:42,000
We prevented another June 22, 1941. It was
a difficult but necessary decision.

33
00:02:42,000 --> 00:02:46,000
There you have it, my friends: “a
difficult but necessary decision.”

34
00:02:46,000 --> 00:02:53,953
Forgive me again for making you look at
that face. I'll explain why I played

35
00:02:53,953 --> 00:02:55,000
this clip.

36
00:02:56,000 --> 00:03:08,866
Solovyov makes it clear that the Russian
side will continue fighting until its

37
00:03:08,866 --> 00:03:12,000
