45
00:03:49,000 --> 00:03:52,116
Things aren't so clear-cut there either,
and their hands aren't clean. But

46
00:03:52,116 --> 00:03:53,000
that's not the point.

47
00:03:53,000 --> 00:04:02,000
The point is that Solovyov is relaying
what he is told to relay.

48
00:04:02,000 --> 00:04:09,000
He conveys our country's position to its
people: the war will continue.

49
00:04:09,000 --> 00:04:15,115
I wrote on my Telegram channel, commenting
on Solovyov's claim that NATO had

50
00:04:15,115 --> 00:04:16,000
