100
00:08:24,000 --> 00:08:29,000
It's all useless; the same old faces are
still in the ring.

101
00:08:29,000 --> 00:08:36,000
So what's the point of stalling? I shared
my view:

102
00:08:36,000 --> 00:08:47,000
the point is that while the current
situation persists and the war continues,

103
00:08:47,000 --> 00:08:56,070
there is still no serious basis for saying
that the Russian Federation in this

104
00:08:56,070 --> 00:08:57,000
conflict

105
00:08:57,000 --> 00:09:02,462
has won a substantial victory or gained
something it can present to the

106
00:09:02,462 --> 00:09:03,000
public,

107
00:09:03,000 --> 00:09:07,139
saying, “Look, dear Russians, this is what
you suffered for, what we

108
00:09:07,139 --> 00:09:10,000
