114
00:09:33,000 --> 00:09:36,000
And I think they understand that perfectly
well.

115
00:09:36,000 --> 00:09:42,578
Even though they live in a land of pink
ponies, they understand perfectly well

116
00:09:42,578 --> 00:09:43,000
that,

117
00:09:43,000 --> 00:09:51,000
in the current circumstances, with the
conflict in its present state,

118
00:09:51,000 --> 00:09:54,000
stopping it carries risks.

119
00:09:54,000 --> 00:10:02,222
Perhaps that's why we hear the rhetoric I
jokingly called “Stall for time,

120
00:10:02,222 --> 00:10:03,000
