133
00:10:47,000 --> 00:10:51,000
In other words, we're talking about a
nuclear apocalypse.

134
00:10:51,000 --> 00:10:56,000
I wonder: is citizen Solovyov ready for a
nuclear apocalypse?

135
00:10:56,000 --> 00:10:58,000
I'm not ready.

136
00:10:58,000 --> 00:10:59,000
I'm not ready.

137
00:10:59,000 --> 00:11:03,000
I don't want a nuclear winter for planet
Earth, I'm sorry.

138
00:11:03,000 --> 00:11:08,000
I don't think you're ready for a nuclear
apocalypse or want one either.

139
00:11:08,000 --> 00:11:12,000
And patriotism has no role to play here.

140
00:11:12,000 --> 00:11:18,000
Billions of people on our planet aren't
ready for it.

141
00:11:18,000 --> 00:11:24,440
Therefore, I sincerely hope the situation
will be resolved in a different way.
